    "The on-device proof is the OWNER's step and is deliberately not a Step-by-Step Task: a Task-linked reminder tapped on his Android phone with the app closed, and again with it open, landing on that Task. Until it passes, the roadmap's unit 7 row stays in-progress and M2 is NOT reached.",
    "The phase-3 UI/UX checklist is 9/9 on static read, but items 5 (focus/Esc/focus-return) and 9 (no cross-origin request) were NOT measured live — the implementer had no browser pane. Flagged in the checklist itself.",
